<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Baobab considering a buy, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Baobab considering a buy, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baobab Solid Growth Limited said on Wednesday it was considering an acquisition and the consequential structure of its investments in financial services.</p>
<p>It said the implementation of the proposal, which is aimed at advancing the firm's investments, could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
